{"id":71776,"date":"2026-10-30T09:07:12","date_gmt":"2026-10-30T09:07:12","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71776"},"modified":"2026-10-30T10:17:11","modified_gmt":"2026-10-30T09:17:11","slug":"meia-maratona-de-fatima","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-de-fatima\/","title":{"rendered":"Renascen\u00e7a Meia Maratona de F\u00e1tima 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Renascen\u00e7a Meia Maratona de F\u00e1tima 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Renascen\u00e7a Meia Maratona de F\u00e1tima 2027<\/strong> (3\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se nos dias <strong>3 e 4 de abril de 2027<\/strong> (s\u00e1bado e domingo), na cidade de <strong>F\u00e1tima<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Our\u00e9m<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>. Com centro de partida e chegada junto ao <strong>Posto de Turismo de F\u00e1tima<\/strong>, o evento proporciona um fim de semana que alia o atletismo de estrada, a supera\u00e7\u00e3o pessoal e a identidade espiritual de um dos destinos mais emblem\u00e1ticos do mundo.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Em pleno planalto da Cova da Iria, na envolvente hist\u00f3rica do <strong>Santu\u00e1rio de F\u00e1tima<\/strong> e da <strong>Capelinha das Apari\u00e7\u00f5es<\/strong>, o programa arranca no s\u00e1bado, <strong>3 de abril<\/strong>, com a tradicional <strong>Cerim\u00f3nia da B\u00ean\u00e7\u00e3o das Sapatilhas<\/strong> e a <strong>Caminhada n\u00e3o competitiva de 6 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>17:00<\/strong>. No domingo, <strong>4 de abril<\/strong>, disputam-se as provas competitivas: a <strong>Meia Maratona (21,097 km)<\/strong> com partida \u00e0s <strong>09:15<\/strong> (organizada por blocos de tempo Sub 1h25, Sub 1h40, Sub 1h50 e +1h50) e a <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela <strong>Ganhardestak<\/strong> com o apoio institucional do <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Our\u00e9m<\/strong>, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o tem um limite de 3.000 participantes e garante t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, dorsal com chip, abastecimentos e medalha de finisher a todos os inscritos. Explora tamb\u00e9m o calend\u00e1rio das melhores <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/meia-maratona\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Meias Maratonas em Portugal<\/a> e prepara a tua prova na <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Ritmo (Pace)<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">3 e 4 de Abril de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Posto de Turismo de F\u00e1tima, Our\u00e9m, Santar\u00e9m<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2nci