027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 4:<\/strong> 16,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (16\/03 a 30\/03\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 6 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 3 de Abril de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 17:00 \u2022 \u23f1\ufe0f Limite: 1h30<\/span><div style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 4px; line-height: 1.4;\">\ud83d\udca7 <strong style=\"color: #E2E8F0;\">Abastecimentos:<\/strong> Abastecimento l\u00edquido a meio do percurso e na meta<\/div><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 10,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 11,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/12\/2026 a 08\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3:<\/strong> 12,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (09\/01 a 15\/03\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 4:<\/strong> 14,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (16\/03 a 30\/03\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e a que horas se realizam as provas da Renascen\u00e7a Meia Maratona de F\u00e1tima 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento decorre em dois dias junto ao Posto de Turismo de F\u00e1tima (concelho de Our\u00e9m): no s\u00e1bado, 3 de abril de 2027, realiza-se a Cerim\u00f3nia da B\u00ean\u00e7\u00e3o das Sapatilhas e a Caminhada de 6 km com partida \u00e0s 17:00; no domingo, 4 de abril de 2027, parte a Meia Maratona (21,097 km) \u00e0s 09:15 e a Corrida de 10 km \u00e0s 09:30.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e prazos de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es est\u00e3o limitadas a 3.000 vagas (at\u00e9 30 de mar\u00e7o de 2027) em 4 fases: At\u00e9 30 de novembro \u2014 17,00 \u20ac (21K), 12,00 \u20ac (10K) e 10,00 \u20ac (Caminhada); de 1 de dezembro a 8 de janeiro \u2014 18,00 \u20ac, 13,50 \u20ac e 11,00 \u20ac; de 9 de janeiro a 15 de mar\u00e7o \u2014 19,00 \u20ac, 14,50 \u20ac e 12,00 \u20ac; e de 16 a 30 de mar\u00e7o \u2014 22,50 \u20ac, 16,00 \u20ac e 14,00 \u20ac.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando funciona o secretariado para levantamento do kit de atleta?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento do dorsal e kit do atleta realiza-se no Hotel Cinquenten\u00e1rio & Conference Center, em F\u00e1tima, no s\u00e1bado, 3 de abril de 2027, das 11:00 \u00e0s 19:30, e no domingo, 4 de abril de 2027, das 07:30 \u00e0s 09:00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e existe servi\u00e7o de bengaleiro?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todos os participantes t\u00eam direito a t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial (corte masculino\/feminino na Meia Maratona e 10K; unissexo na Caminhada), dorsal com chip (provas competitivas), seguro de acidentes pessoais, abastecimentos e medalha de finisher. Existe servi\u00e7o opcional de bengaleiro na zona de partida\/chegada (08:30 \u00e0s 13:00) pelo valor de 2,00 \u20ac no ato de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os tempos limite (cut-off) e blocos de partida da Meia Maratona?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo limite \u00e9 de 3 horas para a Meia Maratona (21,097 km), 1h45 para a Corrida de 10 km e 1h30 para a Caminhada (6 km). A partida dos 21,1 km est\u00e1 organizada em quatro blocos de ritmo: Sub 1h25, Sub 1h40, Sub 1h50 e +1h50.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Renascen\u00e7a Meia Maratona de F\u00e1tima 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-04-03\", \"endDate\": \"2027-04-03\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Posto de Turismo de F\u00e1tima\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Our\u00e9m\", \"addressRegion\": \"Santar\u00e9m\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A Renascen\u00e7a Meia Maratona de F\u00e1tima 2027 realiza-se a 3 e 4 de abril em F\u00e1tima, Our\u00e9m. Provas de 21 km, 10 km e Caminhada 6 km. Consulta guia e inscreve-te!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-meia-maratona-de-fatima.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@